# Ignore build output "bin" folders everywhere EXCEPT the website's Bin,
# which contains vendored third-party assemblies required for CI builds.
# Project outputs (Chai.*) inside the website Bin stay ignored - CI rebuilds them.
[Bb]in/
!/WebSites/WorkflowManagment/Bin/
/WebSites/WorkflowManagment/Bin/Chai.*
[Dd]ebug*/
*.lib
*.sbr
obj/
[Rr]elease*/
_ReSharper*/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*
*.vssscc
$tf*/
